[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; Stylized Nature MegaKit (Quaternius, CC0 — see CREDITS.md). Used at scale 1.0: unlike the
; village building pack (which needed 1.8x), this pack is authored at 1:1 real scale — a 9.44 m
; broadleaf, 8.72 m pine and 13.28 m dead tree are all plausible real heights against a 2 m player.
;
; No offset on Y. The model's base sits at -0.24, so the roots sink slightly into the ground
; instead of meeting it on a clean seam — which is what you want.
;
; NO COLLISION, deliberately. The perimeter trees are visual only; the Barriers are the sole
; thing bounding the play space (see tests/test_village_boundaries.gd:17). Adding collision here
; would change the playable space those tests assert on.

[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://assets/models/nature/tree_broadleaf.glb" id="1_tree"]

